    "description": "Service booking platforms connect customers with appointments, accommodation, and other services whose availability depends on a provider's capacity. Iranian examples illustrate the differences between discovering a provider, reserving a service, and receiving that service.",
    "tags": ["Service booking", "Online appointments", "Travel technology", "Digital platforms", "Iran"],
